WEBVTT

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:14.570
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.810
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:22.150
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.250
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.190
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.110
Do you swear that you will live on together?

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.380
Yes! l do.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.480
How about you, Shu?

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.050
l do.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.160
Then l will too!

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.560
Not two, but three of us together.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:53.600
The childhood game that l remember the most

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:57.260
is the wedding game that my sister liked.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:01:00.700
Okay, let's go to bed now.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.940
What, l want to do it again.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.980
The ending was always the same,
Mom and the two of us all together.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.510
Okay, okay.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.790
Let's do it when we wake up tomorrow.

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.950
l didn't really understand the meaning of the pledge.

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:23.150
Simply because Mom and my sister seemed to be having fun,

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.820
it was fun for me too.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:30.760
<i>Till Death Do Us Part</i>
l really didn't understand what life and death meant.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:37.210
That's why l had no idea what happened to my mom that morning.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.780
l didn't have a dad. l didn't know him.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.510
l didn't understand.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.420
My sister, my mom and me.

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.750
The Hayasaka family consisted of the three of us and

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.460
a one-bedroom apartment.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.390
lt's dangerous outside, so don't go out.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.730
—Okay!
—Okay!

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:03.370
Mom left for work early and came back late.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.000
During that time,

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:08.040
my sister and l listened to what Mom had said

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.540
and never left the room.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.510
As time passed by,

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.680
we matured as if we were competing against each other,

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:21.220
but somehow Mom grew smaller and thinner.

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:28.120
And one morning, my mom did not move.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:33.060
Mommy, wake up, it's morning.
Wake up, Mommy!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.530
We waited.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.830
But although we waited for a long time,

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.640
Mom did not wake up.

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:47.080
Soon we grew impatient and,

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.850
we violated what our mom had told us,

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.940
and decided to go out.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.090
Outside!

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.520
Let's go outside!

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:59.260
But Mommy said outside is...

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.200
But...

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:18.440
—Open up!
—Open up!

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.080
We called for help.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:20.980
Open up!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.610
ln order to be heard, we yelled at the top of our lungs.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.790
That room is always loud, and it's very disturbing, isn't it?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.050
lt's the best not to deal with other people's business.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.860
Shut up, you brats, be quiet!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:38.430
Our voices did not reach anywhere.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:45.300
No, it's not that it didn't reach, no one tried to listen.

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:49.610
l wonder how much time passed.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:54.310
That day without any warning,

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.920
we were taken into police custody.

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:00.550
No, l didn't notice a bit.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:04.080
Since it was always quiet, l had no idea there were kids.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.520
ln the end, we learned that the woman we thought was our mother

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.300
had kidnapped us from our parents,

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:17.200
kept us locked up, and raised us.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.950
Our real parents refused to take us back.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:31.250
We had no other place to go.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.590
We snuck out of the hospital.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:43.120
ln order to make sure that we would not get separated.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.530
Where do you want to go now?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.730
Anywhere is fine.

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:54.370
But... you have to stay with me.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:55.710
Sis?!

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:59.370
Always...together, okay?

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.440
Till death do us part...

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:09.590
Gimme money, food... and medicine!

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:16.430
My, my, what a cute mugger.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.130
You have good eyes.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.830
They're starting to stain in a good way.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.270
See, just as l said.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:27.470
There is always something good during a walk in the moonlight.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.610
This is sure worth getting.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.580
Come with us, kid.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.470
From your appearance,

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.950
l bet you don't have a place to go to.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:36.910
No!

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:40.150
l am not gonna go anywhere without my sister!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:44.290
l don't mind.
Then bring her along.

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:48.530
However...it's going to be hard for her to stay alive

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.960
if your sister doesn't have those eyes.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:59.870
At LXE, there were many kids who were adopted besides us.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:05.310
But only a handful were able to survive to this day.

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.440
The rest were left out and eaten.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:12.550
Shusui Senpai, Ouka Senpai.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.650
l know...
We don't blame anyone for it.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.790
That's why we don't care about this world.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:26.300
Actually, this world has no meaning to us.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:32.970
Our only wish is to become homunculi,

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.270
to gain a life where even death can't separate us,

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.080
and to live on together in a world just by ourselves.

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.080
ls that all you want to say?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:48.380
l don't care if you think you are the most unfortunate.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.960
But a homunculus eats humans.

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:52.820
l definitely can't allow you

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.760
to become homunculi and cause that kind of pain to others!

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:58.170
You can die happily together!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.760
Wait a sec!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.400
What are you doing, Kazuki?

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.670
How can you tell them to die?

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:10.780
They are still humans!

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.180
But they're our enemies who sold their souls to the homunculi.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.450
l'm going to kill the homunculi! l'm going to kill our enemies!

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.880
No! They're still humans!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.320
They can start over from here!

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:28.630
lt could not happen for Chono, but this time...

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.400
This time...!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.640
You are saying that you are going to protect the enemies,

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.330
the Hayasaka twins?

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:41.130
They can no longer fight.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.110
Plus, l don't want to kill anyone.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.140
l don't want you to either!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:54.980
Kazuki...your kindness becomes your liability during a fight.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:59.260
l am sure that it will someday kill you.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:03.660
Before that happens,
I'll take away your means to fight!

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.030
Forgive me, Kazuki!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.800
l am going to end your life as a warrior right here and now!

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.400
Stop, Tokiko!

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.710
Are you all right, Sis?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.370
Sis!

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:21.710
l'm fine, l guess.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.480
But either way, it's over.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.290
Mission has failed.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.520
Now, either we get eaten by the homunculi

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:33.430
or get killed by the warrior.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.200
We have lost already.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:43.530
Move!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.080
Good for you for not leaving.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.680
We already gave up, so...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.010
That's a nice attitude.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.230
Kazuki.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:14.260
l said you can't kill them.
They are humans!

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.540
You still don't understand?!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.040
They are allied with the homunculi, you know.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.600
Who do you want to save? Your sister and friends, or these guys?

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.410
Both! l want to protect both!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.590
D-Don't mess around and choose!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:32.750
That's impossible!

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.350
lt's impossible for me to decide who lives.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.590
lf there is a life l can save, then l will save all of them!

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.990
Because you saved my life.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:47.630
By using the kakugane... you saved me.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:52.270
l didn't die and become separated from Mahiro or my friends.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:55.140
And l was able to meet you.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.240
From this night,

00:09:57.310 --> 00:10:01.650
even these two may be able to open the door to a new life

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.580
where they do not have to be alone anymore.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.850
That's why you can't just get rid of them!

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.650
<i>l want to become</i> <i>as powerful as possible.</i>

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.330
<i>For my sister!</i>
<i>And for our wish!</i>

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:24.030
<i>I'll win. l can't lose here.</i>

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:26.730
Kazuki!

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:48.990
Sis?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:54.400
Sis... Sis...!
Why...why...?

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.470
Well, l wonder why...

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:06.310
l just thought if that day, when the apartment doors closed,

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:12.680
if Kazuki was right outside, then l bet he would have saved us.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:19.630
l thought he might have become our friend...

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.950
l imagined that...then...

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:28.200
Till death do us apart...

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.570
Finally...l guess that day has come.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.030
Thanks for...everything...

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.400
Not yet! Don't give up, Senpai!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:40.640
Kakugane!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.310
lf you use the healing power of the kakugane, we can save her!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.860
lt's no good.
The bleeding doesn't stop.

00:11:51.260 --> 00:11:52.690
ls two still not enough?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:53.890
Tokiko!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:12:00.270
l'm not capable of taking out the kakugane from my own body.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.770
Tokiko, you are going to decide whether

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.730
you are going to save a life or not!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.610
l have to choose, huh?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.810
You didn't even bother to choose when l asked the question.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:17.580
Fine. Unlike you, l am going to choose.

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:19.580
Buso deactivate.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.160
Thank you! Tokiko!

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:25.550
Do as you please,

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.860
and if that doesn't help, then you can give up.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.060
All right! The bleeding stopped!

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.890
Good, we can save her!

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:35.670
ln times of health or sickness,

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:39.300
...happiness or sadness,

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:40.900
ln wealth...

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:42.840
...or in poverty,

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.980
—we will love, respect,
—— we will love, respect,

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.350
...comfort, support,

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.110
—until death sets the two apart.
—until death sets the two apart.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.650
—Do you promise to live together?
—Do you promise to live together?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.190
l'm glad, l'm glad.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:02.390
That you didn't have to suffer like you did last time.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.740
But the twins over there don't seem to be in good condition.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.700
Even if they are to open up a new world,

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:19.040
the world they lived in until now was the dark world of alchemy.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:22.370
lt's not that easy to separate.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:29.090
Moon! Life is so helpless.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.690
Moon!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:33.520
What are you doing here?

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:36.000
lt should be my duty to be the watcher.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.000
A walk in the moonlit night.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:47.140
l was wondering how good... the warrior who defeated you was,

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.180
but he doesn't seem to be that impressive.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:54.780
Don't make such a scary face.
Smile smile.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.020
l don't plan to snatch your enemy.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:13:59.920
But l will make the two,

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:02.480
who failed their mission, my dinner.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:06.660
Oh yeah, the day l found them was a moonlit night like this.

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:09.730
l thought they were worth picking up.

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:10.820
Huh?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.460
Comet Bravo Kick.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:19.940
—How suspicious!
—How suspicious!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:26.040
l see, so you are the third one and also the leader.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.040
lf you plan to lay your hands on the children, then...

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.510
l am your opponent!

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:31.780
With pleasure!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.750
l want to say that, but unfortunately,

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:37.220
l have been told by Dr. Butterfly to hold back.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:40.090
lt's regretful, but l must leave for tonight.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.690
What's your name?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.390
Captain Bravo.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:48.860
Moon... What a nice name. l am Moon Face.

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:51.300
Let's battle it out someday.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:54.070
M-Moon!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.070
Yeah...as you wish.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:14:59.970
The other one left too.

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.580
Ten days have passed since

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.280
Hayasaka Senpai was in a car accident,

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.880
and we're finally able to find out where they are hospitalized.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.680
Let's go see them!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.350
Car accident?

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:13.190
That's outside my jurisdiction.
Don't ask.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.560
l am leaving those siblings up to the Warrior Chief,

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:20.630
but l wonder how much information he was able to get from them.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:24.940
l am more worried about how they are recovering.

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:28.140
Besides related officials, visitors are not allowed!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.820
Do we have to be a family member in order to be allowed in?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:40.020
For that matter, what are we to them anyway?

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:41.580
Just underclassmen?

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.520
No!

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:45.220
We compared sizes with him already!

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.490
So we are definitely beyond relatives!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:48.490
Yup!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.390
What the hell were you guys doing?!

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:52.090
ln that case, we also...

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.630
You compared sizes?

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.070
Most definitely!

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.270
So, let's charge in!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:00.740
Excuse me!

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:02.780
Hey, kids!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.570
lf you fool around with medical personnel,

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:05.810
then you are going to pay the price!

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:10.180
We doctors know the most about the importance of health.

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.050
That's why health is always our top priority!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.150
Come fight!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.890
What's wrong with this hospital?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.220
Brother, take this!

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:22.020
Got it!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.230
Kazuki, this too.

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:24.060
Got it!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:30.400
Oh Mr. Bravo, are you here for a visit again?

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:32.430
Yes, thank you for everything.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:33.560
The two fled!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.540
Hey hey, don't run in the hallway.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:41.850
<i>Hayasaka</i>
This hospital is a purveyor to the troops,

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.490
so they accommodate our needs.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.220
Senpai, l'm coming in!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:52.320
Hey, you came, Bravo!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.760
l'm impressed you don't get sick of coming every day. Oh!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.560
Kazuki is here too, huh.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.290
Ouka can't hold long conversations yet.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:06.900
So, l am interrogating her by leaving his language function on.

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:08.130
Yup!

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.930
Wow, it's a talking Buso Renkin.

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:13.710
lt's a screwy Buso Renkin.

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:18.150
Oh? l don't want a scarred-up lady to call me that.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.190
l mean, come on, Valkyrie Skirt?

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.560
Which part of it is supposed to be "Deathscythe" exactly, eh?

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.980
Help... Help!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.490
l'm curious to know how the AI works.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.890
Should l dismantle it?

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.890
Actually, l was curious too.

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.030
Okay!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.300
Bravo Arts, one of 13!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.330
All-seeing Bravo Eye!

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:41.040
l saw through it.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.000
Wow, is that a Silver Skin feature too?

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:47.540
Negative! This sight is due to intensive training.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:52.350
lt seems like Ouka and Gozen are sharing their consciousness.

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.390
ln other words, that is the other Ouka Hayasaka.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.360
He is camouflaging her with that big smile.

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:03.000
By the way Ouka Senpai, where is Shusui Senpai?

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:05.930
Huh?

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:11.210
Shusui Hayasaka was already released this morning.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.070
You want to go into training?

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:19.040
Yes, with the teacher who trained me in swordsmanship before.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.710
Do you want to win against Kazuki by getting stronger?

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.490
No.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.160
l want to win against myself.

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:36.520
Very well. But l need to confiscate the kakugane.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:40.900
Plus, l need you to promise that you will contact us once a week.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:43.800
Sis...

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.370
l know. Go ahead.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:51.010
Sorry. But l promise to come back.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:01.750
Until now, we said we wished to live on together,

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:04.990
but we were just relying on each other.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.330
Since we were closed up in our own world,

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.430
we were terrified that death might separate us.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:15.360
From now on, we are going to be able to

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:19.800
stand alone, walk alone, and live alone...

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:23.770
Then let's live on together in a new world.

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.640
l am holding on to this for Shusui.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:38.860
Ah! No wonder l thought l smelled something good.

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:39.920
lt's the melon!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.830
Oh, l almost forgot. Here.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:47.970
lt's covered with blood!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.860
This is for you, Senpai.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.900
lt's from Mahiro and the others.

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:54.830
Smells good.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.310
Everyone was very worried.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:01.140
When you get better, let's all go hang out.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.790
A new world where you don't have to be alone is waiting for you.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.690
lt smells really good...

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:19.090
lt almost makes me want to deliver some to Shusui.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.190
Smell of flowers?

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.070
l guess not.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:31.380
But, it sure smelled really good.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:46.310
A campus covered in fog.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:49.140
Screams of students echo before countless monsters.

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:51.740
ln order to not make any other sacrifices like before...

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.210
Run Kazuki!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.580
Next episode, "Carnival."

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.590
I'll splatter your guts out!

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.230
<i>Mahiro's Buso Renkin Seminar</i>
Hello! This is Mahiro Muto!

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:06.890
I'll again be introducing the Buso Renkin

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.230
in a way everyone can understand!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:15.070
Our fourth presentation is the Angel Gozen, and Sword Samurai X!

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:19.970
Beautiful, handsome, smart, and even athletically outstanding!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.910
No matter how you look at them,

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:26.010
the twins Ouka and
Shusui Hayasaka are so perfect!

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:30.150
But the two were LXE familiars.

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:32.480
There, the two received the kakugane

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:35.030
and gained the power of Buso Renkin.

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:41.020
And that is Ouka Senpai's Angel Gozen and Shusui Senpai's Sword Samurai X

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.130
Angel Gozen's distinctive characteristic has got to be

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.400
that ugly-cute Automaton,
Angel Gozen!

00:21:48.810 --> 00:21:52.140
Angel Gozen shares its consciousness with Ouka Senpai

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:55.270
and is always busy crying and getting angry,

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.710
but that is supposed to be another personification

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:58.940
of Ouka Senpai's personality.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.410
Although Tokiko says

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:03.280
it's because "that woman is dark-hearted!"

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:05.350
Oh yeah! When attacking,

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:10.450
Angel Gozen uses Ouka Senpai's bow and arrow to create high-speed shots!

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.760
That's right, it is perfectly capable of attacking as well.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:17.130
Angel Gozen has one other special property

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:20.660
which is to transfer another's physical damage to Ouka Senpai herself

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:22.600
by shooting them with her arrow.

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:26.370
Ouka Senpai used this ability to save my big brother.

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:29.240
lt must've really hurt, didn't it?

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:35.050
Oh, Ouka Senpai really was a nice person. l knew it...

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.140
Continuing on we have Shusui Senpai,

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:41.320
the person who gave my big brother one tough battle,

00:22:41.390 --> 00:22:44.190
his Buso Renkin is Sword Samurai X!

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:48.660
The fact that Shusui Senpai, a master of kendo, wields a Japanese Katana,

00:22:48.730 --> 00:22:51.100
makes him have the strength of Samson,

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:54.100
but the Sword Samurai X also has the special property

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:56.770
to completely neutralize energy-based attacks.

00:22:57.040 --> 00:23:00.910
The blade absorbs the energy and releases it from the bottom cord!

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:04.610
Which means all of Big Brother's energy-based attacks

00:23:04.680 --> 00:23:06.380
with the Sunlight Heart is absorbed

00:23:06.450 --> 00:23:09.220
and therefore has no effect on Shusui Senpai.

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.780
Big Brother himself thought

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:13.850
he was done for against this special property.

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:17.390
Although Ouka Senpai and
Shusui Senpai have been through a lot,

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:19.990
thanks to my big brother's good heart,

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:22.160
they have changed their ways and both are now our friends!

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:26.200
We even have an unbreakable bond from comparing each other's sizes!

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:28.900
l'd like all of us to go to the bathhouse together again.

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:31.800
Okie dokie, tune in next time!
